<title>ESTONIA: HOIUPANGA LIISING TO ITS ISSUE FIRST CPS.</title>
<headline>HOIUPANGA LIISING TO ITS ISSUE FIRST CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupanga Liising, the leasing subsidiary of Hoiupank , will on June 20 issue its first commercial papers, Hoiupank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It will issue 30 million kroons of three-month commercial papers with a yield of 7.10 percent, the bank's capital markets head, Hassar Kipp, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
